#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/3-record_export.md:29
#: f33b806f47cf442b8be6468915a86832
msgid ""
"git clone --recursive git@github.com:fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2.git\n"
"cd lerobot_ros2\n"
"./init.sh all\n"
"# motion / task queue only:     ./init.sh all-motion\n"
"# recording plugins (if you skipped all):  ./init.sh install-lerobot\n"
"source .venv/bin/activate"
msgstr ""
"git clone --recursive git@github.com:fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2.git\n"
"cd lerobot_ros2\n"
"./init.sh all\n"
"# motion / task queue only:     ./init.sh all-motion\n"
"# recording plugins (if you skipped all):  ./init.sh install-lerobot\n"
"source .venv/bin/activate"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/3-record_export.md:38
#: 74defa243af648eea15dd43694444eb4
msgid ""
"`./init.sh all` = submodules + env + task orchestration + LeRobot "
"plugins. Bare `pip install -e .` at the repo root is not the install "
"path."
msgstr ""
"`./init.sh all` = 子模块 + 环境 + 任务编排 + LeRobot 插件。仓库根目录裸 `pip install -e .` "
"不是安装路径。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/3-record_export.md:40
#: 5d9f2e0dcb884e0b8f2f70b407a77b63
msgid ""
"Isaac example README also lists `./init.sh install-plugins` for this "
"checkout. Use the **lerobot_ros2** `./init.sh`, not a handwritten PyPI "
"`rclpy` install."
msgstr ""
"Isaac 示例 README 还写了本仓的 `./init.sh install-plugins`。用 **lerobot_ros2** 的 "
"`./init.sh`，不要手写从 PyPI 装 `rclpy`。"

